asty":"明"}},{"title":"江门钓濑与湛民泽收管 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"小坐江门不记年，蒲裀当膝几回穿。\n如今老去还分付，不卖区区敝帚钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42445,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门钓濑与湛民泽收管 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"皇王帝伯都归尽，雪月风花未了吟。\n莫道金针不传与，江门风月钓台深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42446,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门钓濑与湛民泽收管 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"江门渔父与谁年，惭愧公来坐榻穿。\n问我江门垂钓处，囊里曾无料理钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42447,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与湛民泽","author":"陈献章","text":"六经尽在虚无里，万里都归感应中。\n若向此边参得透，始知吾学是中庸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42448,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江门钓台","author":"陈献章","text":"何处江边著钓台，楚云溟月尽收回。\n若比桐江还胜槩，千年埋没一朝开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42449,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再用韵与湛民泽","author":"陈献章","text":"日斜刘九放船回，层起江门水底台。\n浩浩碧波山锁断，潮打厓门两扇开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42450,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"民泽祖樵林居士搆堂于上游庄民泽乞题","author":